.TH sway-things-wallpaper-next 1 "" "Sway Things 0.4.0" "Sway Things Manual"
.SH NAME
sway\-things\-wallpaper\-next \- Show the next picture of the collection
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsway\-things wallpaper next\fR [\fB\-\-device\fR] [\fB\-\-due\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the next picture of the collection
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-device\fR \fI<IDENTIFIER>\fR
The display, as for `get`; without one, the collection of every display
.TP
\fB\-\-due\fR
Only if its time has come; without a sway session, stop the timer instead
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Controls when to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
